<section class="shell band">
  <h1>Our LPC Associates</h1>
  <div class="answer">
    <p>Finding Balance Counseling works as a supervised practice. Alongside Reem Glasco, LPC-S,
    a group of <strong>LPC Associates</strong> sees clients under her supervision, which means
    the same clinical lineage at <strong>lower fees and sooner availability</strong>. Sessions
    run <strong>$100 to $165</strong> for 50 minutes depending on the associate, and most hold
    a limited number of <strong>sliding-scale places from $70</strong>. Most work online across
    Texas; one also sees clients in person in Austin. Every associate offers a free consultation
    first.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cta-row">
    <a class="cta" href="/contact/">Ask which associate fits</a>
    <a class="cta cta--quiet" href="/therapy/">All therapy options</a>
  </div>
</section>

